IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cpp-core`
IMPORT `cpp-core-calendar`

-- Canada Pension Plan Act -- piece cp4: A CALENDAR HELPER (infrastructure).
--
-- No provision of this piece's range licenses this rule. Sections 55.3(1) and (2), 60(8) and (9) and 63.1(3)
-- each take "the later" of two months; the core's calendar module has no such rule, so it is written once here.

§ `A calendar helper`

-- Not a provision: the later of two months, each given by any date in it. The result is the first day of that month.
GIVEN first IS A DATE
      second IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`cp4 the later of two months` first second MEANS
    IF `the month of a date` first AT LEAST `the month of a date` second
    THEN `the month of a date` first
    ELSE `the month of a date` second
